{"about_the_game":"<strong>Zen World</strong> is your personal little continent-sized relaxing garden, and it's up to you to make it grow and flourish!<br><br>In this world-building relaxing strategy, you start with a tiny patch of land lost among the clouds, and your job is to create a beautiful and safe environment for the people of your kingdom.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Build a world tile by tile by matching border types</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485650/extras/c4dda45e4baad69e545766d226972737.poster.avif?t=1636055333\" width=610 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485650/extras/c4dda45e4baad69e545766d226972737.webm?t=1636055333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485650/extras/c4dda45e4baad69e545766d226972737.mp4?t=1636055333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>Create paths to valuable loot for your scouts</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485650/extras/20cb2dbdfd3f21d0265c73086273c7f7.poster.avif?t=1636055333\" width=610 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485650/extras/20cb2dbdfd3f21d0265c73086273c7f7.webm?t=1636055333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1485650/extras/20cb2dbdfd3f21d0265c73086273c7f7.mp4?t=1636055333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>Open boxes to get more tiles and powerups</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a